  "build": {
    "buildCommand": "cd /Users/liuyue/Desktop/Github_repos/dawn-science; python3 - <<'PY'\nimport pathlib\np = pathlib.Path(\"e2e/sidebar-layout.spec.ts\"); s = p.read_text(encoding=\"utf8\")\nold = \"\"\"  expect(有一条时 - 空的时候).toBeLessThan(一条行高 * 1.6)\"\"\"\nnew = \"\"\"  /**\n   * **上界从 1.6 放到 2.4**（2026-08-12）。\n   *\n   * 侧栏加了分区标题「对话 N」（作者要的，学自 WorkBuddy）——\n   * 多出来的那一行是**内容**（它说「下面这些是一类，一共几条」），\n   * 不是空占的间距。\n   *\n   * **这条断言原本守的东西没变**：中间不许有白占的空隙。\n   * 一行会话 + 一行标题仍然应当远小于两行会话的量级。\n   */\n  expect(有一条时 - 空的时候).toBeLessThan(一条行高 * 2.4)\"\"\"\nassert old in s\ns = s.replace(old, new, 1)\np.write_text(s, encoding=\"utf8\")\nPY\nnpx tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json 2>&1 | grep -v notice | head -2; npm run build >/dev/null 2>&1 && npx playwright test e2e/sidebar-layout.spec.ts e2e/who-answered.spec.ts 2>&1 | grep -E \"passed|failed\" | tail -2",
    "testCommand": "cd /Users/liuyue/Desktop/Github_repos/dawn-science; python3 - <<'PY'\nimport pathlib\np = pathlib.Path(\"src/ui/views.tsx\"); s = p.read_text(encoding=\"utf8\")\n\n# 会话区加分区标题（带计数）\nold = \"\"\"      <ul className=\"session-list\">\n        {sessions.length === 0 ? null : (\"\"\"\nnew = \"\"\"      {/**\n        * **分区标题 + 计数**（2026-08-12，学自 WorkBuddy 的 `任务 (5) ⌄`）。\n        *\n        * 我们此前是一列平铺的行，**没有节奏**——扫一眼分不出哪几行是一类。\n        * 计数不是装饰：它回答「我这儿攒了多少东西」，\n        * 而那正是人决定要不要清理的依据。\n        *\n        * **一条都没有时整块不出现**（与列表同一条纪律）：\n        * 一个写着 `(0)` 的标题占一行、什么都没说。\n        */}\n      {sessions.length > 0 ? (\n        <p className=\"side-section\">\n          对话 <span className=\"side-count\">{sessions.length}</span>\n        </p>\n      ) : null}\n      <ul className=\"session-list\">\n        {sessions.length === 0 ? null : (\"\"\"\nassert old in s\ns = s.replace(old, new, 1)\n\nold2 = \"\"\"      <ul className=\"proj-list\">\n        {projects.length === 0 ? (\"\"\"\nnew2 = \"\"\"      {projects.length > 0 ? (\n        <p className=\"side-section\">\n          项目 <span className=\"side-count\">{projects.length}</span>\n        </p>\n      ) : null}\n      <ul className=\"proj-list\">\n        {projects.length === 0 ? (\"\"\"\nassert old2 in s\ns = s.replace(old2, new2, 1)\np.write_text(s, encoding=\"utf8\")\n\np = pathlib.Path(\"src/ui/styles.css\"); s = p.read_text(encoding=\"utf8\")\ns += \"\"\"\n/* 侧栏的分区标题（2026-08-12，学自 WorkBuddy 的 `任务 (5)`）。\n   **它不是一行可点的东西**，所以更小更淡、且上面留白比下面大——\n   「它统领下面这些」这句话是靠间距说的 */\n.side-section {\n  margin: var(--dawn-space-4) 0 var(--dawn-space-1);\n  padding: 0 var(--dawn-space-3);\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  color: var(--dawn-text-3);\n  letter-spacing: 0.03em;\n}\n.side-count {\n  margin-left: 4px;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n\"\"\"\np.write_text(s, encoding=\"utf8\")\nPY\nnpx tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json 2>&1 | grep -v notice | head -2; npm test 2>&1 | grep -E \"Tests |FAIL\" | head -3",
    "lintCommand": null,
